## The Glass Stair

::bg{location="lighthouse" time="noon"}
::music{playback="change" mood="tense" volume="up" assetId="music.tense"}
::actor{character="mara" anchor="center" action="fadeIn" emotion="worried" costume="raincloak"}
::actor{character="elio" anchor="right" action="fadeIn" emotion="surprised" costume="coat"}
::camera{focus="mara" framing="close" transition="wipeLeft"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The lighthouse door opens onto a stair made of glass. Below it, the sea is much too near.
@elio{code="0010" emotion="surprised"}: The stairs are humming.
@mara{code="0010" emotion="worried"}: They remember every footstep.
<match subject="run.choice">
  <when is="tower">
    @mara{code="0020" emotion="hopeful"}: We chose the high road. Now we finish it.
  </when>
  <when is="harbor">
    @elio{code="0020" emotion="happy"}: You chose the long way around, and somehow it led here.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @narrator{code="0020"}: You cannot remember choosing a road, only that it is behind you.
  </otherwise>
</match>
<branch id="crossing" prompt="A bell rings above the stair. The next step is already fading." timeout="8" default="steady">
  <choice id="steady" text="Cross together">
    ::set{run.trust += 1}
    @mara{code="0030" emotion="hopeful"}: Hand in hand. No vanishing alone.
  </choice>
  <choice id="rush" text="Run for the lantern">
    ::set{run.trust -= 1}
    @elio{code="0030" emotion="worried"}: Mara, wait!
  </choice>
</branch>
::cg{assetId="cg.lighthouse" display="show" layout="full"}
@narrator{code="0030"}: Behind the lantern, a figure turns toward you. It has Mara's eyes.
::cg{assetId="cg.lighthouse" display="hide"}
::sfx{sound="glass" assetId="sfx.glass"}
::vfx{type="shake" transition="wipeLeft"}
::actor{character="mara" emotion="angry" action="shake"}
@mara{code="0040" emotion="angry"}: My sister. She is still here.
